    "Both arms pass 2/2. Task-class mean capped goal time is 14.0024582247 versus 6.67630379001 minutes, a 52.3204877109 percent descriptive reduction on this development task only.",
    "In both candidate trajectories the selected confirmation method was the first qualifying method in the recorded observation order. TREC-0 had no qualifying initial proposal; TREC-1 first completed b1-s0 was invalid and then b0-s0 qualified. Deferred selection did not switch the confirmation method in these two recorded trajectories.",
    "The two arms independently generated different methods from identical first prompts and the same model. These two faster candidate outcomes do not identify a causal benefit from deferred confirmation. Neither fixed-observation replay nor this small task subset replaces the full prospective/default criteria.",
    "Three episodes failed their unique confirmation and continued to final acceptance after the full six-call exploration budget. Preserving exploration after a negative confirmation was necessary in those observed traces; it is shared behavior, not a new intervention benefit.",
    "Control final audits have fewer errors (32 and 28) than candidate (37 and 33), but both reach the same predefined goal. Final prediction quality and time to accepted research delivery must be reported separately.",
    "All 25 stored candidate prediction sets and corresponding reference point losses independently checked. Original bootstrap comparisons retained, not rerun by this review. Full campaign verification pending."
  ],
